      "contentPreview": "The plugin-authoring doc was the most dangerous artifact the server drop left behind, and it took three passes to notice.  It described writing a .NET DLL, dropping it in a server\u0027s plugin directory, and being loaded through an AssemblyLoadContext into a DI container. src/ contains no AssemblyLoadContext, no Assembly.LoadFrom and no Activator.CreateInstance \u2014 the loader was the server\u0027s. Anyone following the guide would have built something nothing loads, and nothing would have told them.  It su",
